        "formativeAssessment": "Observable indicators: (a) the revised map includes a 'Combined Operations' node with connections to all four law nodes; (b) a direct arrow links the map to the phenomenon; (c) lesson numbers are annotated on at least 4 connections; (d) the 'Final Answer' box is present and contains a complete sentence. Teacher photographs each final map as a portfolio artefact. Groups whose maps are missing the phenomenon connection or the combined-operations node are identified for follow-up consolidation support."
